# ACT 1 · Apartment bedroom · Blaire monologue as she wakes from the dream (before the ghost appears).
join Blaire rightmost [animation="Fade In" extra_data="set Expression/Thinking"]
Blaire: [pause=0.5]...Huh.
Blaire: That field again. And that big, broken... thing.
update Blaire [extra_data="set Expression/Serious"]
Blaire: It said my name. It sounded so happy to see me.
update Blaire [extra_data="set Expression/Reassure"]
Blaire: [pause=0.3]It's just a dream, Blaire. Get up.
update Blaire [extra_data="set Expression/Alert"]
Blaire: Oh no. Oh no, the bus.
leave Blaire [animation="Fade Out"]
